Author: Gianluca Bontempi


Python code for the handbook 
"Statistical foundations of machine learning: the handbook"
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/242692234_Statistical_foundations_of_machine_learning_the_handbook
and the book
"Statistical foundations of machine learning: the book"
https://leanpub.com/statisticalfoundationsofmachinelearning


## Downloading datasets for the package

Large files are not stored in GitHub.

Run:
- bash
- pip install -r requirements.txt
- python download.py